@startuml
title TMFOP012 consumer role
participant "Consumer DataResourceConfig" as CCR
participant "TMFOP012" as Op
participant "Keycloak" as KC
participant "TMFC060 TMFxxx API" as API
participant "Binding Secret" as Sec
participant "DependentAPI" as Dep
Op -> CCR : watch (provider odaComponent, role consumer)
Op -> Op : resolve the provider by componentId or componentName
Op -> API : use knowledgeId, or POST /knowledge from create{...}
Op -> KC : map knowledge-viewer (+ knowledge-editor for readWrite)\nto service-account-<consumer>
Op -> Sec : apiUrl, queryUrl, mcpUrl, kbId, providerComponent, qdrantCollection (ownerRef to the CR)
Op -> Dep : apiType mcp, the provider's knowledgemcp ExposedAPI (ownerRef to the CR)
Op -> CCR : status.bindings[], conditions
== delete ==
Op -> KC : unmap the granted roles
note right of Op : Secret and DependentAPI go with their ownerRef;\nthe knowledge-base is kept
@enduml
